// The SDK lives in this checkout; there is no published module.
//
// A REPLACE PATH IS A FUNCTION OF WHERE THIS FOLDER SITS, and this copy sits in the WORKSPACE
// (`workspaces/bugbounty/actors/desync`), four levels under the repo root, not in the
// kontra-actors checkout three levels under `/root/oss`. `kontra deploy` builds a Go actor with
// the REPO ROOT as the Docker context — it has to, because these replaces point outside the
// actor dir — and it refuses an actor that is not under that root. So the path here is
// ../../../../, and the sibling copy in kontra-actors keeps ../../../kontra/ for its own layout.
// The two go.mod files differing on exactly this line is correct, not drift.
replace github.com/medmahmoudi26/kontra/sdk/go => ../../../../sdk/go

replace github.com/medmahmoudi26/kontra/runtime/go => ../../../../runtime/go
